<title>USA: Showers forecast for W Africa cocoa areas - WSC.</title>
<headline>Showers forecast for W Africa cocoa areas - WSC.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, MASS. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Showers and thunderstorms are expected to increase in West African cocoa areas Tuesday and Wednesday, forecaster Weather Services Corp said.</p>
<p>A few of them are expected to be moderate to heavy on Tuesday with 50-60 percent coverage. Temperatures are expected to be seasonable.</p>
<p>The outlook is for isolated showers during Thursday and Friday with scattered showers and thunderstorms returning on Saturday.</p>
</text>
